Source: https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/v2.7.18/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-docs/src/docs/asciidoc/features/testing.adoc

Shows how to use @DataMongoTest for testing Spring Data MongoDB applications. It configures an in-memory embedded MongoDB (if available), a MongoTemplate, and scans for @Document classes and repositories.

```Java
