Source: https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/v2.7.18/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-docs/src/docs/asciidoc/features/testing.adoc

Demonstrates how to configure @DataMongoTest to exclude the in-memory embedded MongoDB auto-configuration, allowing tests to run against a real MongoDB server instead.

