## 7. `@Spy` — Partial Mocking

```java
@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)
class EmailFormatterTest {

    @Spy
    private EmailFormatter emailFormatter = new EmailFormatter(); // real object

    @Test
    void shouldCallRealMethodButStubHelper() {
        doReturn("CUSTOM_SUBJECT").when(emailFormatter).buildSubject(any());

        String result = emailFormatter.format(new Lead("L1", "Solar", "NEW"));

        assertThat(result).contains("CUSTOM_SUBJECT");
        verify(emailFormatter).buildSubject(any()); // verify the spy was called
    }
}
```

